{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25026","headline":"题茅山仙台药院 · 刘言史","name":"题茅山仙台药院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扰扰浮生外，华阳一洞春。\n道书金字小，仙圃玉苗新。\n芝草迎飞燕，桃花笑俗人。\n楼台争耸汉，鸡犬亦嫌秦。\n愿得青芽散，长年驻此身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}